    {
      "id": "control",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Asset & Pattern Library\nDecision: Which recurring configurations are evidenced Patterns, and which persistent value candidates qualify as Assets?\nOwns: Recurring structural pattern, admission evidence, Asset qualification, maturity and reuse.\nExcludes: Method steps, canonical authority, Service scope, Benefit measurement, Work Object queue or runtime execution.\nOpen HTML: [[00_SYSTEM/NAVIGATOR_SUPPORT/CURRENT/COMPONENTS/ELEMENT_ASSET_PATTERN_LIBRARY_v1.2.html]]\nReturn: [[00_HOME]]\nPPV: Potential | Authority: HELD for operational mutation | Replay: PRESERVED",
